warning[G007]: row_number() ordering can tie
 --> models/marts/latest_payment.sql:4:9
  |
4 | qualify row_number() over (partition by order_id order by paid_at desc) = 1
  |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ several rows can share the same (paid_at) within PARTITION BY (order_id)
  |
  = note: the window reads one row per (payment_id): key of ledger.payments (meta.cardinal.grain)
  = note: tied rows are numbered in any order, so a dedup on this row_number keeps a random one, and a rerun can keep a different one
  = help: add payment_id to the ORDER BY as a tie-breaker
  = see: cardinal explain G007

